---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../lib/site';
---
<PageLayout
  title="Privacy"
  seoTitle="Privacy Notice for This Website"
  description="This website has no accounts or ads. We use Google Analytics to count visits. Photos you choose for Photo pairs stay in your browser and are never uploaded."
  path="/privacy/"
  crumb="Privacy"
  updated="2026-10-25"
  lede="The short version: no accounts and no ads. We use Google Analytics to see how many people visit and which pages help, and photos you choose for Photo pairs never leave your browser."
>
  <p>This notice covers the website at {SITE.domain}, published by Cloudjet Solutions Pte. Ltd., Singapore. The Golden Moments mobile app has its own <a href="/app-privacy/">app privacy policy</a>, and you can find every policy on our <a href="/legal/">legal page</a>.</p>

  <h2>What we do not collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>No accounts, sign-ups, names or email addresses are needed to use the site.</li>
    <li>No advertising, session recording or social media tracking scripts are loaded.</li>
    <li>Game choices and progress are not sent anywhere. They exist only in your browser tab.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2 id="google-analytics">Google Analytics</h2>
  <p>
    We use Google Analytics 4, a service from Google, to count visits and see which pages and games are used, so we
    can improve the site. When a page loads, Google Analytics sets cookies in your browser (named <code>_ga</code>
    and <code>_ga_X4CNGM5F8Z</code>) and sends Google the page address, the page that linked to it, your browser,
    device and screen size, an approximate location based on your IP address, and a random identifier for your
    browser. We have turned off Google signals and ad personalization, so these visits are not used for advertising.
    Google Analytics is not loaded on Photo pairs.
  </p>
  <p>
    Google describes how it uses this information in
    <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" rel="noopener">How Google uses information from sites that use its services</a>.
    To opt out, block cookies for this site, turn on your browser’s tracking protection or install
    <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" rel="noopener">Google’s opt-out add-on</a>. The site works the
    same either way.
  </p>

  <h2>Cookies</h2>
  <p>
    The only cookies are the Google Analytics cookies above. Our host, Cloudflare, may also set a strictly necessary
    security cookie if it needs to check for automated traffic.
  </p>

  <h2>Photos in Photo pairs</h2>
  <p>
    When you choose photos for <a href="/games/photo-pairs/">Photo pairs</a>, your browser reads them from your device
    and shows them on the page. The photos are not uploaded to us or to anyone else, and they are not saved. They are
    gone when you tap “Clear photos”, reload or close the page.
  </p>

  <h2>What stays in your browser</h2>
  <p>
    If you turn soft sounds on or off, the site remembers that one choice in your browser’s local storage so it is the
    same next time. It is never sent to us. You can clear it at any time by clearing this site’s data in your browser.
  </p>

  <h2>Hosting</h2>
  <p>
    The site is served by Cloudflare. Like any web host, Cloudflare processes technical information needed to deliver
    pages and protect the site from abuse, such as your IP address, browser type and the page requested. We do not
    add our own server logging on top of this. Cloudflare’s handling is described in the
    <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/" rel="noopener">Cloudflare privacy policy</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>If you email us</h2>
  <p>
    Writing to us shares your email address, your message and any attachments with us and the email services involved.
    We use them to reply, deal with a privacy or rights request and meet legal obligations, and we keep them only as long
    as reasonably needed for that. To ask for access, correction or deletion, email
    <a href={`mailto:${SITE.supportEmail}?subject=Website%20privacy%20request`}>{SITE.supportEmail}</a>. Please do not
    send family photos, diagnoses or identity documents just to ask a question.
  </p>

  <h2>Links to other sites</h2>
  <p>
    Our guides link to sources such as government and charity websites, and to the App Store and Google Play. Those
    sites have their own privacy practices.
  </p>

  <h2>Children</h2>
  <p>This website is meant for adults and is not directed at children under 13.</p>

  <h2>Changes and contact</h2>
  <p>
    If this notice changes, we will update the date at the top. Questions? Email
    <a href={`mailto:${SITE.supportEmail}`}>{SITE.supportEmail}</a>.
  </p>
</PageLayout>
